%% Media upload - presigned to quarantine, validate, promote - ADR-013, SEC-013
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant A as Android App
    participant API as API - media module
    participant OS as Object Storage
    participant W as Worker
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    U->>A: select image
    A->>A: compress on device - longest edge 1600px, under 500KB (MEDIA-FR-001, NFR-PERF-005)
    Note right of A: compression failure means upload is refused,<br/>never send the original

    A->>API: POST /media/upload-slot (declared type, size)
    API->>DB: validate against SS12 limits, count per post (BR-013)
    API->>DB: INSERT media state=PENDING
    API-->>A: presigned PUT to quarantine/ + media id

    A->>OS: PUT bytes directly to quarantine/
    A->>API: POST /media/{id}/complete
    API->>DB: enqueue validation (same transaction)

    W->>OS: read object from quarantine/
    W->>W: inspect MAGIC BYTES - never extension or client MIME (SEC-013)
    alt valid JPEG / PNG / WebP / PDF
        W->>OS: move to media/ under RANDOM name (SEC-015)
        W->>OS: derive thumbnail variant (MEDIA-FR-002)
        W->>DB: state=READY
    else invalid or executable
        W->>OS: DELETE object
        W->>DB: state=REJECTED
        Note right of W: only this file fails;<br/>siblings untouched (EDGE-013)
    end

    U->>A: publish post
    A->>API: POST /posts with media ids
    API->>DB: REJECT unless every media row is READY
    Note over W,DB: daily sweep removes PENDING/REJECTED older than 24h,<br/>orphans, and media of erased accounts (PRIV-007)
